1
00:00:04,180 --> 00:00:12,500
Let anyone who has any objection to 
Lady Elianna Bernstein standing as my queen come forward now!

2
00:00:22,260 --> 00:00:28,130
<i>Oh no. I thought I was supposed
to be a fiancée in name only.</i>

3
00:00:41,220 --> 00:00:46,290
<i>So much is happening at once,
I can't keep things straight.</i>

4
00:00:47,780 --> 00:00:54,160
<i>Me, as the princess…
Your Highness, what did you mean by that?</i>

5
00:00:54,160 --> 00:00:56,660
<i>I'm a phony…</i>

6
00:00:56,660 --> 00:00:58,160
Eli.

7
00:01:01,080 --> 00:01:02,700
Lord Theodore.

8
00:01:05,380 --> 00:01:06,690
My apologies.

9
00:01:07,780 --> 00:01:13,220
We considered you to be in danger,
so we didn't allow you near the archives.

10
00:01:13,220 --> 00:01:16,980
However, since the danger has passed,
please feel free to use them again.

11
00:01:17,790 --> 00:01:18,680
Okay.

12
00:01:19,440 --> 00:01:21,440
I must apologize as well.

13
00:01:21,440 --> 00:01:24,190
We were all on edge for some time.
It must have been unpleasant.

14
00:01:24,190 --> 00:01:25,480
That isn't true...

15
00:01:25,480 --> 00:01:28,940
Good grief, your emotions are written all over your faces.

16
00:01:28,940 --> 00:01:31,210
I'm the same as I always am, though.

17
00:01:32,560 --> 00:01:33,900
I suppose that's true.

18
00:01:35,540 --> 00:01:41,000
<i>I... want to stay with them forever.</i>

19
00:01:42,040 --> 00:01:43,530
<i>I'm so happy.</i>

20
00:01:45,320 --> 00:01:48,000
At any rate, Chris really had us fooled.

21
00:01:48,000 --> 00:01:52,360
It was unexpected for you to use that situation
to push your marriage forward.

22
00:01:53,900 --> 00:01:55,390
Opportunity only knocks once.

23
00:01:55,860 --> 00:01:59,140
The last barrier, Earl Casull, has given in as well.

24
00:01:59,140 --> 00:02:02,730
Even the elder Bernstein
should have nothing to fuss over.

25
00:02:02,730 --> 00:02:04,100
<i>My grandfather?</i>

26
00:02:04,530 --> 00:02:09,190
It felt like things were going to be wrapped up soon.
You should be grateful I called Eli here when I did.

27
00:02:09,190 --> 00:02:15,820
Well, personally, I wouldn't have minded
if things soured between you two.

28
00:02:15,820 --> 00:02:20,910
That's enough. Please stop making illicit solicitations
towards your <i>nephew's</i> betrothed.

29
00:02:23,330 --> 00:02:26,460
Well, I am the one Eli gets along with the best.

30
00:02:26,460 --> 00:02:30,000
I'd appreciate it if you'd stop
saying Eli's nickname repeatedly.

31
00:02:30,000 --> 00:02:32,840
That's quite enough of your banter, thank you.

32
00:02:33,170 --> 00:02:38,890
Have you forgotten all the new work piling up
thanks to the statements made by Your Highness?

33
00:02:39,350 --> 00:02:42,270
I'm begging you, give us a break.

34
00:02:42,270 --> 00:02:43,680
Like with the unofficial matter

35
00:02:43,680 --> 00:02:46,730
where we suddenly have to secure
a month's worth of hard evidence in three days time...

36
00:02:46,730 --> 00:02:49,710
are you trying to work us to death?

37
00:02:50,480 --> 00:02:53,170
Three days is plenty of time.

38
00:02:53,170 --> 00:02:56,910
We were rushed no matter the time limit you gave us...

39
00:02:56,910 --> 00:02:58,240
Time limit?

40
00:02:58,260 --> 00:03:01,260
Oh, no... well...

41
00:03:01,260 --> 00:03:02,740
Good grief.

42
00:03:02,740 --> 00:03:06,540
The first "Brain of Sauslind" to be brought back
onto the political center stage

43
00:03:06,540 --> 00:03:10,420
after generations of absence,
was nearly driven back into isolation again.

44
00:03:10,420 --> 00:03:15,970
What on earth was our "Prince Charming" <i>doing</i>
during the four year time limit he was given?

45
00:03:15,970 --> 00:03:20,850
I couldn't agree more. Who would have thought
that our handsome prince was this helpless?

46
00:03:24,830 --> 00:03:28,150
Once again, I am Alan Ferrera.

47
00:03:28,150 --> 00:03:32,020
I am the one who spread
your "fairy princess" nickname around for you.

48
00:03:32,020 --> 00:03:34,030
Fairy princess?

49
00:03:34,690 --> 00:03:40,240
So, is he honestly moving from
the Fairy Princess to Lady Irene?

50
00:03:40,240 --> 00:03:42,910
<i>I'm a fairy princess? </i><i></i>

51
00:03:43,400 --> 00:03:48,560
<i>In the past, I have been called
the "Phantom of the Library," but...</i>

52
00:03:50,010 --> 00:03:54,420
I'd be overjoyed if you would be just as open with me
as you are with Alex and the others.

53
00:03:54,420 --> 00:04:00,430
Alan, now that you've outed yourself publicly,
it will make it difficult for you to fulfill your role in the future.

54
00:04:00,430 --> 00:04:03,760
What? It's about time, isn't it?

55
00:04:03,760 --> 00:04:07,910
It's already common knowledge in some circles
 that I am the prince's secret pawn.

56
00:04:09,030 --> 00:04:13,250
I apologize for not noticing you up to now.

57
00:04:14,160 --> 00:04:18,950
I will be more careful going forward,
O master musician of the royal court.

58
00:04:19,400 --> 00:04:23,490
To think I hadn't been noticed once
over the course of four years...

59
00:04:23,490 --> 00:04:25,200
Also, Alan. My name is Alan.

60
00:04:23,660 --> 00:04:24,910
I am Alan...

61
00:04:26,060 --> 00:04:26,580
Eli!

62
00:04:29,260 --> 00:04:30,540
Brother.

63
00:04:30,540 --> 00:04:33,440
I heard about the commotion...
Are you all right?

64
00:04:33,440 --> 00:04:34,210
Yes.

65
00:04:35,120 --> 00:04:36,590
Good to hear.

66
00:04:36,590 --> 00:04:37,960
Alfred.

67
00:04:38,340 --> 00:04:43,090
Give this message to the elder Bernstein.
Tell him "All requirements have been met."

68
00:04:43,620 --> 00:04:47,220
Okay. I will let him know. However,

69
00:04:47,660 --> 00:04:50,770
if you ever make my sister look so heartbroken again,

70
00:04:50,770 --> 00:04:54,560
there will be consequences, even if I have to mobilize
all of the Bernstein's brainpower.

71
00:04:54,560 --> 00:04:56,150
Please keep that in mind.

72
00:04:56,150 --> 00:04:57,900
Brother?

73
00:04:57,900 --> 00:04:59,400
I'll take that to heart.

74
00:05:00,940 --> 00:05:04,410
Your Highness, the king
and the prime minister would like to see you.

75
00:05:04,810 --> 00:05:07,410
They'd like to hear the details of this situation.

76
00:05:07,410 --> 00:05:08,410
The king?!

77
00:05:10,740 --> 00:05:14,170
Tell them to give me some time,
I have an urgent matter to attend to.

78
00:05:14,170 --> 00:05:17,170
It's a grave matter concerning
the destiny of the royal family.

79
00:05:18,920 --> 00:05:22,430
Uncle, Alex, I'm counting on you to explain ahead of time.

80
00:05:23,450 --> 00:05:27,970
<i>A grave matter concerning
the destiny of the royal family?!</i>

81
