1599
00:07:05,800 --> 00:07:07,240
<i>That's what he said, but...</i>

1600
00:07:09,240 --> 00:07:12,740
<i>What is going on here?</i>

1601
00:07:15,600 --> 00:07:17,500
I've finally caught you.

1602
00:07:17,500 --> 00:07:19,580
Y-Your Highness?

1603
00:07:19,580 --> 00:07:24,260
I'm sorry, Eli... I've incited so many misconceptions
and given you much anxiety.

1604
00:07:25,540 --> 00:07:33,430
To tell the truth, when I got engaged to you, I was given
requirements by the elder Bernstein and the Marquess.

1605
00:07:33,430 --> 00:07:34,890
Requirements?

1606
00:07:36,700 --> 00:07:44,070
First, you must receive approval from the other nobles,
without using the Bernstein's hidden name.

1607
00:07:44,490 --> 00:07:49,160
Second, Eli needs to become more interested in you
than she is in books.

1608
00:07:49,460 --> 00:07:52,830
The deadline was four years,
the time until you came of age.

1609
00:07:52,830 --> 00:07:56,790
If those requirements were not met by then,
the engagement would be...

1610
00:07:57,160 --> 00:08:02,370
You were to stay at the estate with the Marquess and Alfred.

1611
00:08:02,370 --> 00:08:03,170
Oh...

1612
00:08:03,170 --> 00:08:08,320
Therefore, even though I came of age,
I couldn't proceed with the marriage plans.

1613
00:08:08,940 --> 00:08:11,390
I wish you had said so much earlier...

1614
00:08:12,310 --> 00:08:13,390
Yes.

1615
00:08:15,370 --> 00:08:19,140
Had I told this to the Eli from four years ago,

